on><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85WzAeickVbQUUFNEDdpbdqnkCa2kQrCvvTLBiapJfoMIWsJEJaicib0uyhxj9y6T7xbJ1velQiaK7iaPYSD0sic6ibK8juyt10Vw5NUQbA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>IAS</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1．中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>2．在校期间未受过纪律处分。</span></p><p><span>3．具有良好的身体和心理素质，身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></p><p><span>4．在目前就读学校取得学校推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生，推荐手续完备，材料齐全。</span></p><p><span>5．2027年9月1日前须获得毕业证书及学士学位证书。</span></p><p><span>6．教育部规定的其他条件要求。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85X5nIdwmyibeqv12JXeppA6ccYF5Ctm71Xcker9iaicWzVnQosBL1raJ0uKVQOicibQI300jNA0JS4ZfzWGF5gWQClTU6StSFsUw570/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二、申请程序</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>IAS</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）预报名：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>即日起有意向的同学可登录“深圳大学推免生预报名系统</span><strong><span>http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm</span></strong><span>”进行网上预报名，已报本院暑期学校的同学无需重复报名。填报时须选择“106高等研究院”中的相关专业，并根据要求上传各项材料。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（二）学院通知复试：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>我院将尽快审核申请材料并组织面试（线上）。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85VPFibib6yREO3WvsXja95pMy8rm1cXc2xBTIVz5lVTcf6wo6luIicp5dh5OdxhlgPwy8c6YvSNHIHMc3l4icFOlwpXWicBLwic7iaaOI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三、学院简介</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>IAS</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>深圳大学高等研究院成立于2014年，是深圳大学的一个创新综合办学单位，突出小规模、高水平、跨学科、重基础、研究型、国际化的培养模式，下设数学与应用数学、物理学、化学、生物科学四个基础学科方向。近年来，高等研究院围绕空间科学、微生物组学、合成生物学、纳米科学、数据科学等交叉领域，开展创新人才培养、尖端科学研究和高新技术开发。学院现有专任教师52名，专职研究人员20名，博士后80名，拥有多名国家级人才。近5年，在Nature、Nature Communications、Physical Review Letters等国际知名期刊发表论文千余篇。过去三年中毕业的硕士研究生约1/3选择继续深造。国外去向包括：普林斯顿大学、美国西北大学、新加坡国立大学等国际知名学府；国内去向包括：北京大学、中山大学、厦门大学、上海交通大学、复旦大学、华南理工大学等。此外，约2/3的硕士毕业生选择就业，进入华为、TCL、福田区教育局等知名企业或事业单位工作。高等研究院根据课程特点、学生能力和教学效果，采用中英双语教学。目前，学院研究生规模达到250余人，设有数学、物理学、化学、以及生物学4个学术硕士学位点对外招生。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>详细学科专业和导师介绍：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>https://ias.szu.edu.cn/rcpy/yjs/gssxwdzdjs.htm</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85VJ6rVEqsbs3noUvOmk15ajISoUfxBzwHvBpJzXtZJGKlqc1PA1RBfNOaUO2pdo5ynDHLWCqB7x10plCficYnjswcVCmrEpUtAE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四、招生专业</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>IAS</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><sect